//// set: en-t2 — for 语句、归约、推导式在枚举 / Boolean 上迭代：保留形态、类型不符的下标、Integer(i)、参数 / 常量数组
//// model: T20
model T20
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z; algorithm z := 0; for i in E loop z := z + y[i]; end for;
end T20;
//// model: T21
model T21
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[E]; algorithm for i in E loop z[i] := y[i] * 2; end for;
end T21;
//// model: T22
model T22
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3]; algorithm for i in E loop z[Integer(i)] := y[i]; end for;
end T22;
//// model: T23
model T23
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z; algorithm z := 0; for i in E loop if i == E.two then z := z + y[i]; end if; end for;
end T23;
//// model: T24
model T24
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; E e; algorithm e := E.one; for i in E loop if y[i] > 1 then e := i; end if; end for;
end T24;
//// model: T25
model T25
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3]; algorithm for i in E loop z[i] := y[i]; end for;
end T25;
//// model: T26
model T26
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3]; algorithm for i in 1:3 loop z[i] := y[i]; end for;
end T26;
//// model: T27
